[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dtolnay/anyhow/issues/comments/1208243152","html_url":"https://github.com/dtolnay/anyhow/pull/251#issuecomment-1208243152","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dtolnay/anyhow/issues/251","id":1208243152,"node_id":"IC_kwDODLEmts5IBFPQ","user":{"login":"RalfJung","id":330628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMDYyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/330628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung","html_url":"https://github.com/RalfJung","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-08-08T15:00:26Z","updated_at":"2022-08-08T15:01:23Z","body":"Note that this matches the behavior before https://github.com/dtolnay/anyhow/pull/249, because anyhow used to check the wrong env var for this. 1.0.60 is the only version of anyhow that ever respected RUSTC_WRAPPER.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dtolnay/anyhow/issues/comments/1208243152/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dtolnay/anyhow/issues/comments/1208793765","html_url":"https://github.com/dtolnay/anyhow/pull/251#issuecomment-1208793765","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dtolnay/anyhow/issues/251","id":1208793765,"node_id":"IC_kwDODLEmts5IDLql","user":{"login":"jonhoo","id":176295,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NjI5NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176295?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonhoo","html_url":"https://github.com/jonhoo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonhoo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonhoo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonhoo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonhoo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonhoo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonhoo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonhoo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonhoo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonhoo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-08-09T01:33:07Z","updated_at":"2022-08-09T01:33:07Z","body":"I don't actually know of a use of `RUSTC_WRAPPER`, so can't really add much info. I've heard of it being used to always append certain `rustc` flags no matter which source is used for the rustc flags that Cargo decides to use, but don't have a concrete example I can link to.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dtolnay/anyhow/issues/comments/1208793765/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dtolnay/anyhow/issues/comments/1208853293","html_url":"https://github.com/dtolnay/anyhow/pull/251#issuecomment-1208853293","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dtolnay/anyhow/issues/251","id":1208853293,"node_id":"IC_kwDODLEmts5IDaMt","user":{"login":"RalfJung","id":330628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMDYyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/330628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung","html_url":"https://github.com/RalfJung","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-08-09T02:52:57Z","updated_at":"2022-08-09T02:52:57Z","body":"> I would prefer to ignore only rust-analyzer's buggy RUSTC_WRAPPER specifically. Does it have some kind of recognizable name we could look for?\r\n\r\nI'll have to forward that question to @lnicola","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dtolnay/anyhow/issues/comments/1208853293/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dtolnay/anyhow/issues/comments/1208886292","html_url":"https://github.com/dtolnay/anyhow/pull/251#issuecomment-1208886292","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dtolnay/anyhow/issues/251","id":1208886292,"node_id":"IC_kwDODLEmts5IDiQU","user":{"login":"lnicola","id":308347,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwODM0Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/308347?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lnicola","html_url":"https://github.com/lnicola","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lnicola/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lnicola/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lnicola/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lnicola/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lnicola/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lnicola/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lnicola/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lnicola/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lnicola/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-08-09T04:06:36Z","updated_at":"2022-08-09T04:06:36Z","body":"> Does it have some kind of recognizable name we could look for?\r\n\r\nRA sets itself as the wrapper, so it should be called `rust-analyzer` or `rust-analyzer.exe`. However,\r\n\r\n - a tool based on RA might use the same approach\r\n - as mentioned in the issue, IntelliJ Rust [takes the same approach](https://github.com/intellij-rust/intellij-rust/tree/3ec36ffd96c31b6e1252e473fe8f133fbf1e2d33/native-helper) (which is where we stole it from from)\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dtolnay/anyhow/issues/comments/1208886292/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dtolnay/anyhow/issues/comments/1209297769","html_url":"https://github.com/dtolnay/anyhow/pull/251#issuecomment-1209297769","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dtolnay/anyhow/issues/251","id":1209297769,"node_id":"IC_kwDODLEmts5IFGtp","user":{"login":"RalfJung","id":330628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMDYyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/330628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung","html_url":"https://github.com/RalfJung","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-08-09T12:09:27Z","updated_at":"2022-08-09T12:09:27Z","body":"This should help for RA, not sure if we want to start carrying a list of all the broken wrappers out there...","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dtolnay/anyhow/issues/comments/1209297769/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dtolnay/anyhow/issues/comments/1209638591","html_url":"https://github.com/dtolnay/anyhow/pull/251#issuecomment-1209638591","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dtolnay/anyhow/issues/251","id":1209638591,"node_id":"IC_kwDODLEmts5IGZ6_","user":{"login":"jonhoo","id":176295,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NjI5NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176295?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonhoo","html_url":"https://github.com/jonhoo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonhoo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonhoo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonhoo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonhoo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonhoo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonhoo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonhoo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonhoo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonhoo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-08-09T17:01:55Z","updated_at":"2022-08-09T17:01:55Z","body":"I've found one use of `RUSTC_WRAPPER` in an internal code-base, and it's used to append to `$PATH` before delegating to the real `rustc`. And I'm not even sure that particular use is needed any more. That said, it does feel unfortunate to ignore `RUSTC_WRAPPER` entirely — even though _I_ don't need it, chances are that if someone _does_ set it it makes a difference to their use-case.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dtolnay/anyhow/issues/comments/1209638591/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dtolnay/anyhow/issues/comments/1209698359","html_url":"https://github.com/dtolnay/anyhow/pull/251#issuecomment-1209698359","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dtolnay/anyhow/issues/251","id":1209698359,"node_id":"IC_kwDODLEmts5IGog3","user":{"login":"RalfJung","id":330628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMDYyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/330628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung","html_url":"https://github.com/RalfJung","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-08-09T17:57:34Z","updated_at":"2022-08-09T17:57:34Z","body":"OTOH, given that autocfg is widely used and https://github.com/cuviper/autocfg/issues/26 has seen very little activity, it doesn't seem to be terribly common for RUSTC_WRAPPER to be used in a way that just ignoring it causes a lot of trouble.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dtolnay/anyhow/issues/comments/1209698359/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dtolnay/anyhow/issues/comments/1211420254","html_url":"https://github.com/dtolnay/anyhow/pull/251#issuecomment-1211420254","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dtolnay/anyhow/issues/251","id":1211420254,"node_id":"IC_kwDODLEmts5INM5e","user":{"login":"RalfJung","id":330628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMDYyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/330628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung","html_url":"https://github.com/RalfJung","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalfJung/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-08-11T00:00:26Z","updated_at":"2022-08-11T00:00:26Z","body":"Sure, that also works. I locally disabled the rustc-wrapper hack anyway, just posted this because I felt bad for my previous PR triggering that problem.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dtolnay/anyhow/issues/comments/1211420254/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]